# URLs lychee cannot reach from CI. One regex per line.

# Own domains: internal-only services, OIDC callback endpoints that reject a
# bare GET, and hosts behind self-signed certs. Covers apex and subdomains.
https?://([a-z0-9-]+\.)*javydekoning\.com

# Cluster-internal addresses, resolvable only from inside the cluster.
https?://([a-z0-9-]+\.)*svc\.cluster\.local
https?://kubernetes\.default\.svc
https?://loki:
https?://0\.0\.0\.0

# Helm chart repos: `repo:` roots serve index.yaml but 404 on the bare URL, so
# a hit here is not a broken link. Listed per-repo rather than excluding all of
# github.io, which would also stop checking genuine documentation links.
https?://awslabs\.github\.io/mountpoint-s3-csi-driver
https?://kubernetes-sigs\.github\.io/node-feature-discovery/charts
https?://anza-labs\.github\.io/charts
https?://pajikos\.github\.io/home-assistant-helm-chart
